Found 2026-09-29 by the first CI run of Getty/p5-kubernetes-comb (run 36611696953, all three Perl versions).

Dist-Zilla-PluginBundle-Author-GETTY 0.326 went to CPAN on 2026-09-29 17:21 UTC. Its cpanfile requires Dist::Zilla::Plugin::GatherAgentContext 0.001, and its bundle adds the plugin. This distribution has never been released: no tag, Changes still says "Initial release" under {{$NEXT}}, MetaCPAN answers 404 for the module and for the release.

So the bundle cannot be installed from CPAN:

    ! Installing the dependencies failed: Module Dist::Zilla::Plugin::GatherAgentContext is not installed
    ! Bailing out the installation for Dist-Zilla-PluginBundle-Author-GETTY-0.326.

Every CI that installs the bundle through the shared dzil-test action fails at that step, before any test of the distribution runs. Machines that have the plugin installed from this checkout do not notice.

Needed: the first release of this distribution, by the maintainer. Nothing else in the dependents has to change.
